# ============================================================================
# 2K Football Mod Tools — public beta repository ignore list
#
# This workspace doubles as a private reverse-engineering lab.  NOTHING retail
# or bulky may ever be committed: no game images, no extracted game data, no
# Ghidra projects, no build artifacts.  The release archives shipped as GitHub
# Release assets are independently verified retail-free by the packaging gate.
# ============================================================================

